{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55125","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游都将，克日至行年。\n约束（京本作「若属」）我军牢固守，若（辛本、川本作「莫」）教见阵必遭愆（京本作「邅」），不鬬却爲贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}